Package: landfall
Title: Site Maps and Colony Records for Antarctic Expeditions
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Michael", "Wethington", , "michael.wethington@briloon.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Draws a relief map of the surroundings of any Antarctic site and
    places a new penguin colony count against the site's record in the Mapping
    Application for Penguin Populations and Projected Dynamics (MAPPPD). A site
    is given by its four-letter MAPPPD code or by a name and coordinates, the
    map covers a chosen radius, and one call renders a figure with the map, the
    long-term trend and how the new count compares with earlier seasons. Every
    input is packed into a local folder beforehand, so the figures render with
    no network connection.
